# Admin panel (outside product)

Operator tooling lives in `_admin-panel/`, not in Follio product features.

## Modules stay separate

- `modules/developer/` — health, suites, Live QA, resume reader (AI lab), smoke
- `modules/users/` — placeholder for future user monitoring

Do **not** import developer ↔ users. The shell only composes them via `_admin-panel/nav.ts`.

## When shipping features

1. Update `modules/developer/suites-catalog.ts` / `smoke.ts` / `links.ts` / `live-qa/catalog.ts` / `ai/` as needed
2. Thin shims only: `app/admin/(dashboard)/developer/page.tsx`, `app/api/admin/developer/*`

## Access

- UI: `/admin/developer` (requires Admin table auth)
- Suite + Live QA runs: local only (`DEVTOOLS_ENABLED=true`, never in production)
- Public must never reach these APIs without admin auth
